  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region bounded by the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, the tangent to it at the point whose ordinate is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> and the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, is:"
  },
